     5703   ON LEAVE OF v-susp-chk IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     5704   DO:
     5705     assign
     5706       v-susp-chk.
     5707               find first ub.susp-chk exclusive-lock where ub.susp-chk.doc-code = tt-chk-doc.doc-code no-error .
     5708               if available (ub.susp-chk) then do:
     5709                   if v-susp = "Иная: " then ub.susp-chk.reason-name = v-susp + v-susp-chk .
     5710                   else ub.susp-chk.reason-name = v-susp-chk .
     5711               end.
